// dms devtools: set by `dms play` on the command line when the board reloads the map in place (key H).
// Not saved: they only apply to the launch that set them. Plain local cvars (`nosave`), not `user`
// ones: a user cvar goes into the player's userinfo, which has a size limit, and a long arrival
// message once stopped UZDoom at startup ("User info descriptor too big").
nosave string dms_spawn = "";     // "x y z angle pitch": where to put the player on arrival
nosave string dms_message = "";   // Claude's replies, shown on arrival ("|" separates lines)
